# Route: guide 6 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199 of
# 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 17 to 21, 42
# quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Silverpine Forest): The Sepulcher -> The Decrepit Ferry -> Olsen's
# Farthing -> The Greymane Wall -> Pyrewood Village -> Beren's Peril ->
# Ambermill -> The Sepulcher -> The Dead Field -> Malden's Orchard ->
# Ambermill -> The Sepulcher -> The Decrepit Ferry -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arugal's Folly (99; Moonrage
# Watcher 13-14, Moonrage Sentry 14-15, Moonrage Elder 14-15, Moonrage Armorer
# 14-15, Moonrage Tailor 14-15, Moonrage Leatherworker 14-15); Pyrewood Ambush
# (452; Councilman Smithers 12).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Arugal Must Die (1014), Arugal Must Die (1014), Into The
# Scarlet Monastery (1048), Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (1098), Deathstalkers
# in Shadowfang (1098), The Power to Destroy... (5725), The New Plague
# (95216), Heart of Disruption (96984), Source of Power (96988).

